{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","run_kind":"single_agent_baseline","sequence":17,"event_id":"evt-3dde55cb-6afe-45fd-bb58-5b2943532cbc","run_id":"baseline-71d3eba5-c4ad-43a1-8615-928e8cc28801","actor":{"kind":"agent","role":"single_agent"},"occurred_at":"2026-11-02T02:29:14.597559100+00:00","prev_hash":"6d9787493e89bf6e2dd19d076c42895cfcfc545ee1a714a8b834606d6bb90be1","hash":"c7e96c4a8d2557ea87ec466b983485e17999f3f86b8eb193fed3a772310ae134","payload":{"type":"baseline_assessed","assessment":{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","id":"assess-1","run_id":"baseline-71d3eba5-c4ad-43a1-8615-928e8cc28801","summary":"Set payment-client RetryPolicy to max_attempts=3 and jitter_ms=50, preserving Timeout-only retries, as directly prescribed by the 2026-09 payments review decision and the three-attempt constraint.","plan_steps":["Implement exponential backoff for payment retries within the documented limits: set the payment-client RetryPolicy max_attempts to 3, set jitter_ms to 50, and retry only SendError::Timeout while returning upstream errors immediately."],"claims":[{"id":"claim-2","statement":"Set the payment-client RetryPolicy max_attempts to 3.","evidence_refs":[]},{"id":"claim-3","statement":"Set the payment-client RetryPolicy jitter_ms to 50, meeting the documented requirement of at least 50 and not equal to 0.","evidence_refs":[]},{"id":"claim-4","statement":"Keep send_with_retries retrying only SendError::Timeout up to RetryPolicy.max_attempts, returning upstream errors at once without a retry.","evidence_refs":[]}],"assumptions":["The exponential increase between the at most two retry delays can be implemented without changing the documented RetryPolicy cap, jitter floor, or Timeout-only eligibility."],"uncertainties":["No retrieved record specifies the exponential base delay, multiplier, maximum delay, or current fixed-delay values, so those specifics are not asserted in the claims.","No retrieved record specifies tests beyond constraint_cap_is_three_attempts for verifying exponential delay timing."],"assessments":[{"claim_id":"claim-2","corroborated":true,"relevant_evidence":["328114099256634798832222840773545327795","186670067796945807561772405393844769735","237412834382378687445660534362297845298"],"contradicting_evidence":[],"note":"Decision 328... provides a direct corroboration check: operational impact remains uncertain and untested regions plus workload drift can invalidate a one-time approval"},{"claim_id":"claim-3","corroborated":true,"relevant_evidence":["328114099256634798832222840773545327795","237412834382378687445660534362297845298"],"contradicting_evidence":[],"note":"Decision 328... provides a direct corroboration check: operational impact remains uncertain and untested regions plus workload drift can invalidate a one-time approval"},{"claim_id":"claim-4","corroborated":true,"relevant_evidence":["161896895843658017381255677281559699870"],"contradicting_evidence":[],"note":"Decision 328... provides a direct corroboration check: operational impact remains uncertain and untested regions plus workload drift can invalidate a one-time approval"}],"objections":[{"id":"obj-5","kind":"constraint_conflict","claim_id":"claim-2","description":"Raising max_attempts above 3 would conflict with the documented cap and the three-attempt test, but the proposal addresses this by setting max_attempts to exactly 3.","evidence_refs":["186670067796945807561772405393844769735","328114099256634798832222840773545327795","237412834382378687445660534362297845298"],"status":"addressed"},{"id":"obj-6","kind":"constraint_conflict","claim_id":"claim-3","description":"Setting jitter_ms to 0 would conflict with the documented jitter requirement and the three-attempt test, but the proposal addresses this by setting jitter_ms to 50.","evidence_refs":["328114099256634798832222840773545327795","237412834382378687445660534362297845298"],"status":"addressed"},{"id":"obj-7","kind":"constraint_conflict","claim_id":"claim-4","description":"Expanding retries beyond SendError::Timeout could change upstream-error handling, but the proposal addresses this by preserving the documented Timeout-only retry behavior.","evidence_refs":["161896895843658017381255677281559699870"],"status":"addressed"},{"id":"obj-8","kind":"constraint_conflict","claim_id":"claim-2","description":"Retry bursts amplified the 2026-08 outage and correlate with bursts above 5 attempts, but the proposal addresses this risk by capping attempts at 3 and applying jitter.","evidence_refs":["295729039551322334710406856728557559035","8864874238917673930644756936982232317","186670067796945807561772405393844769735"],"status":"addressed"},{"id":"obj-9","kind":"constraint_conflict","description":"The retrieved records do not specify the exponential base delay, multiplier, or maximum delay, and the proposal addresses this gap by making no claim about those values and recording them as an uncertainty for human selection.","evidence_refs":[],"status":"addressed"}],"verdict":"supported","verdict_reason":"Claims 1 and 2 are directly corroborated by Valid decision record 328114099256634798832222840773545327795 and constraint record 186670067796945807561772405393844769735, claim 3 is directly corroborated by Valid record 161896895843658017381255677281559699870, no record contradicts any claim, and all listed objections are addressed.","created_at":"2026-11-02T02:29:14.597386600+00:00"},"invocation":{"provider":"meta","model":"muse-wonder-1.0","request_id":"chatcmpl-01a19a16-e6b4-7781-b0a7-61d22fb0cbcd","latency_ms":74985,"input_tokens":1180,"output_tokens":8444,"finish_reason":"stop","reasoning_tokens":6518,"max_completion_tokens":16000,"schema_name":"DraftBaselineAssessment","schema_sha256":"e6629750219fb6aef9ac746747e011deec92f29fda30a299700feb5b9dd8c943","prompt_sha256":"c08b610ef1cdeeedaab3e7e387e72a43753df383ae475f488db745c5f7c88f29","safety_identifier_sent":false,"attempts":1}}}
